<main id="main"><div class="lp"><section aria-labelledby="lp-title" class="lp-hero"><div class="lp-shell"><p class="lp-kicker">Leadership</p><h1 id="lp-title">The team building Execution Intelligence.</h1><p>A technical founder who built the platform, operators who have run the processes it makes visible, and advisors who have led enterprise transformation at scale.</p></div></section><section aria-labelledby="lp-founder-name" class="lp-band"><div class="lp-shell"><article class="lp-founder lp-card"><figure class="lp-portrait"><img alt="Portrait of Kumar Narala" decoding="async" fetchpriority="high" height="800" loading="lazy" sizes="(max-width: 760px) 90vw, 480px" src="/images/leadership/kumar-narala-640.webp" srcset="/images/leadership/kumar-narala-400.webp 400w, /images/leadership/kumar-narala-640.webp 640w" width="640"/></figure><div class="lp-founder-body"><p class="lp-kicker">Founder</p><h2 id="lp-founder-name">Kumar Narala</h2><p class="lp-title">Founder &amp; Chief Executive Officer</p><hr class="lp-rule"/><p class="lp-bio">Technical founder. Designed RE-ViVE's algorithms and architecture, led engineering, and took the platform from concept to paying enterprise customers.</p><a class="lp-linkedin" href="https://www.linkedin.com/in/kumar-narala-a748892/" rel="noopener noreferrer" target="_blank"><svg aria-hidden="true" viewbox="0 0 24 24"><path d="M20.45 20.45h-3.55v-5.57c0-1.33-.02-3.04-1.85-3.04-1.85 0-2.14 1.45-2.14 2.94v5.67H9.36V9h3.41v1.56h.05c.48-.9 1.64-1.85 3.37-1.85 3.6 0 4.27 2.37 4.27 5.46v6.28zM5.34 7.43a2.06 2.06 0 1 1 0-4.12 2.06 2.06 0 0 1 0 4.12zM7.12 20.45H3.56V9h3.56v11.45zM22.22 0H1.77C.79 0 0 .77 0 1.73v20.54C0 23.23.79 24 1.77 24h20.45c.98 0 1.78-.77 1.78-1.73V1.73C24 .77 23.2 0 22.22 0z" fill="currentColor"></path></svg><span>LinkedIn</span></a></div></article></div></section><section aria-labelledby="lp-team-title" class="lp-band"><div class="lp-shell"><div class="lp-head"><p class="lp-kicker">Leadership team</p><h2 id="lp-team-title">Running the business and the product.</h2></div><div class="lp-team"><article class="lp-card"><figure class="lp-portrait"><img alt="Portrait of Gangadhar Devupalli" decoding="async" height="800" loading="lazy" sizes="(max-width: 760px) 90vw, (max-width: 1080px) 280px, 300px" src="/images/leadership/gangadhar-devupalli-640.webp" srcset="/images/leadership/gangadhar-devupalli-400.webp 400w, /images/leadership/gangadhar-devupalli-640.webp 640w" width="640"/></figure><div class="lp-body"><h3>Gangadhar Devupalli</h3><p class="lp-role">EVP, Product and Operations</p><p class="lp-bio">Runs operations and customer delivery across the US and India. Serial entrepreneur with a successful prior venture.</p><a aria-label="Gangadhar Devupalli on LinkedIn" class="lp-linkedin" href="https://www.linkedin.com/in/dsgangadhar" rel="noopener noreferrer" target="_blank"><svg aria-hidden="true" viewbox="0 0 24 24"><path d="M20.45 20.45h-3.55v-5.57c0-1.33-.02-3.04-1.85-3.04-1.85 0-2.14 1.45-2.14 2.94v5.67H9.36V9h3.41v1.56h.05c.48-.9 1.64-1.85 3.37-1.85 3.6 0 4.27 2.37 4.27 5.46v6.28zM5.34 7.43a2.06 2.06 0 1 1 0-4.12 2.06 2.06 0 0 1 0 4.12zM7.12 20.45H3.56V9h3.56v11.45zM22.22 0H1.77C.79 0 0 .77 0 1.73v20.54C0 23.23.79 24 1.77 24h20.45c.98 0 1.78-.77 1.78-1.73V1.73C24 .77 23.2 0 22.22 0z" fill="currentColor"></path></svg><span>LinkedIn</span></a></div></article><article class="lp-card"><figure class="lp-portrait"><img alt="Portrait of Srinivas Kasavaraju" decoding="async" height="800" loading="lazy" sizes="(max-width: 760px) 90vw, (max-width: 1080px) 280px, 300px" src="/images/leadership/srinivas-kasavaraju-640.webp" srcset="/images/leadership/srinivas-kasavaraju-400.webp 400w, /images/leadership/srinivas-kasavaraju-640.webp 640w" width="640"/></figure><div class="lp-body"><h3>Srinivas Kasavaraju</h3><p class="lp-role">VP, Product &amp; Technology</p><p class="lp-bio">Owns the product and technology roadmap. Former Executive Director, Walmart.</p><a aria-label="Srinivas Kasavaraju on LinkedIn" class="lp-linkedin" href="https://www.linkedin.com/in/srinivas-kasavaraju/" rel="noopener noreferrer" target="_blank"><svg aria-hidden="true" viewbox="0 0 24 24"><path d="M20.45 20.45h-3.55v-5.57c0-1.33-.02-3.04-1.85-3.04-1.85 0-2.14 1.45-2.14 2.94v5.67H9.36V9h3.41v1.56h.05c.48-.9 1.64-1.85 3.37-1.85 3.6 0 4.27 2.37 4.27 5.46v6.28zM5.34 7.43a2.06 2.06 0 1 1 0-4.12 2.06 2.06 0 0 1 0 4.12zM7.12 20.45H3.56V9h3.56v11.45zM22.22 0H1.77C.79 0 0 .77 0 1.73v20.54C0 23.23.79 24 1.77 24h20.45c.98 0 1.78-.77 1.78-1.73V1.73C24 .77 23.2 0 22.22 0z" fill="currentColor"></path></svg><span>LinkedIn</span></a></div></article></div></div></section><section aria-labelledby="lp-board-title" class="lp-band lp-band-paper"><div class="lp-shell"><div class="lp-head"><p class="lp-kicker">Board Members and Advisors</p><h2 id="lp-board-title">Banking and enterprise experience at our table.</h2></div><div class="lp-board-row"><article class="lp-board lp-card"><figure class="lp-portrait"><img alt="Portrait of Anand Kulkarni" decoding="async" height="800" loading="lazy" sizes="(max-width: 760px) 90vw, (max-width: 1080px) 240px, 210px" src="/images/leadership/anand-kulkarni-640.webp" srcset="/images/leadership/anand-kulkarni-400.webp 400w, /images/leadership/anand-kulkarni-640.webp 640w" width="640"/></figure><div class="lp-board-body"><h3>Anand Kulkarni</h3><p class="lp-role">Board Member</p><p class="lp-bio">Former CIO &amp; SVP, Capital Markets and ERPM, at BMO Financial Group, with CIO roles at other banks. Brings banking technology leadership and introductions to mid-size banks.</p><a aria-label="Anand Kulkarni on LinkedIn" class="lp-linkedin" href="https://www.linkedin.com/in/anand-kulkarni-245262" rel="noopener noreferrer" target="_blank"><svg aria-hidden="true" viewbox="0 0 24 24"><path d="M20.45 20.45h-3.55v-5.57c0-1.33-.02-3.04-1.85-3.04-1.85 0-2.14 1.45-2.14 2.94v5.67H9.36V9h3.41v1.56h.05c.48-.9 1.64-1.85 3.37-1.85 3.6 0 4.27 2.37 4.27 5.46v6.28zM5.34 7.43a2.06 2.06 0 1 1 0-4.12 2.06 2.06 0 0 1 0 4.12zM7.12 20.45H3.56V9h3.56v11.45zM22.22 0H1.77C.79 0 0 .77 0 1.73v20.54C0 23.23.79 24 1.77 24h20.45c.98 0 1.78-.77 1.78-1.73V1.73C24 .77 23.2 0 22.22 0z" fill="currentColor"></path></svg><span>LinkedIn</span></a></div></article><article class="lp-board lp-card"><figure class="lp-portrait"><img alt="Portrait of Venkata Ganesham" decoding="async" height="800" loading="lazy" sizes="(max-width: 760px) 90vw, (max-width: 1080px) 240px, 210px" src="/images/leadership/venkata-ganesham-640.webp" srcset="/images/leadership/venkata-ganesham-400.webp 400w, /images/leadership/venkata-ganesham-640.webp 640w" width="640"/></figure><div class="lp-board-body"><h3>Venkata Ganesham</h3><p class="lp-role">Chief Information Security Officer (CISO) &amp; Advisor</p><p class="lp-bio">Entrepreneur and technology executive with more than 30 years of experience spanning enterprise cybersecurity, IT infrastructure, telecommunications and data management. An advisor to RE-ViVE since its inception, Venkata brings deep expertise in security, risk and compliance to the company’s strategy, platform direction and enterprise engagements.</p></div></article></div><div class="lp-advisors"><article class="lp-advisor lp-card"><figure class="lp-portrait"><img alt="Portrait of Murthy Kommireddy" decoding="async" height="500" loading="lazy" sizes="(max-width: 760px) 110px, 180px" src="/images/leadership/murthy-kommireddy-400.webp" srcset="/images/leadership/murthy-kommireddy-400.webp 400w, /images/leadership/murthy-kommireddy-640.webp 640w" width="400"/></figure><div class="lp-advisor-body"><h3>Murthy Kommireddy</h3><p class="lp-role">Advisor</p><p class="lp-bio">Has extensive experience in the US Public sector working on global deployments. Experience varies working with Global entities/enterprises to small start ups. Started his career with Intergraph in the early days of IT development getting global. Currently with Global Nexus partners advising startups in the US, India and Asia Pacific.</p><a aria-label="Murthy Kommireddy on LinkedIn" class="lp-linkedin" href="https://www.linkedin.com/in/kommirem/" rel="noopener noreferrer" target="_blank"><svg aria-hidden="true" viewbox="0 0 24 24"><path d="M20.45 20.45h-3.55v-5.57c0-1.33-.02-3.04-1.85-3.04-1.85 0-2.14 1.45-2.14 2.94v5.67H9.36V9h3.41v1.56h.05c.48-.9 1.64-1.85 3.37-1.85 3.6 0 4.27 2.37 4.27 5.46v6.28zM5.34 7.43a2.06 2.06 0 1 1 0-4.12 2.06 2.06 0 0 1 0 4.12zM7.12 20.45H3.56V9h3.56v11.45zM22.22 0H1.77C.79 0 0 .77 0 1.73v20.54C0 23.23.79 24 1.77 24h20.45c.98 0 1.78-.77 1.78-1.73V1.73C24 .77 23.2 0 22.22 0z" fill="currentColor"></path></svg><span>LinkedIn</span></a></div></article><article class="lp-advisor lp-card"><figure class="lp-portrait"><img alt="Portrait of Rameshwar Balanagu" decoding="async" height="500" loading="lazy" sizes="(max-width: 760px) 110px, 180px" src="/images/leadership/rameshwar-balanagu-400.webp" srcset="/images/leadership/rameshwar-balanagu-400.webp 400w, /images/leadership/rameshwar-balanagu-640.webp 640w" width="400"/></figure><div class="lp-advisor-body"><h3>Rameshwar Balanagu</h3><p class="lp-role">Advisor</p><p class="lp-bio">Chief Enterprise Architect, UNFI. 20+ years of Fortune 500 transformation. Forbes Technology Council.</p><a aria-label="Rameshwar Balanagu on LinkedIn" class="lp-linkedin" href="https://www.linkedin.com/in/ram-balanagu-technology-executive/" rel="noopener noreferrer" target="_blank"><svg aria-hidden="true" viewbox="0 0 24 24"><path d="M20.45 20.45h-3.55v-5.57c0-1.33-.02-3.04-1.85-3.04-1.85 0-2.14 1.45-2.14 2.94v5.67H9.36V9h3.41v1.56h.05c.48-.9 1.64-1.85 3.37-1.85 3.6 0 4.27 2.37 4.27 5.46v6.28zM5.34 7.43a2.06 2.06 0 1 1 0-4.12 2.06 2.06 0 0 1 0 4.12zM7.12 20.45H3.56V9h3.56v11.45zM22.22 0H1.77C.79 0 0 .77 0 1.73v20.54C0 23.23.79 24 1.77 24h20.45c.98 0 1.78-.77 1.78-1.73V1.73C24 .77 23.2 0 22.22 0z" fill="currentColor"></path></svg><span>LinkedIn</span></a></div></article></div></div></section><section class="lp-close"><div class="lp-shell"><p>To speak with the team</p><a href="mailto:connect@revivetoday.com">connect@revivetoday.com</a></div></section></div></main>
</Layout>
